@startuml
title End-to-end: plan, execute, upload, review, finalize
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "Operator UI\n(frontend)" as UI
participant "Backend\n(NestJS)" as API
participant "DomainEvents" as Events
participant "SignalQualityService" as SQ
participant "Drone\n(drone-mock in dev)" as Drone

== Planning (operator) ==
Operator -> UI : draw route, fill form, Save
UI -> API : POST /missions
API --> UI : Mission (DRAFT, route revision 1)
Operator -> UI : Plan
UI -> API : POST /missions/:id/plan\n(Idempotency-Key)
API --> UI : Mission (PLANNED)

== Execution (drone-initiated REST, ADR-0003) ==
Drone -> API : GET /missions?state=PLANNED
API --> Drone : planned missions
Drone -> API : POST /missions/:id/claim {droneId}\n(Idempotency-Key)
API --> Drone : Mission (DISPATCHED)
Drone -> API : POST /missions/:id/status {RUNNING}
API --> Drone : Mission (RUNNING)
Drone -> API : POST /missions/:id/status {COMPLETED}
API --> Drone : Mission (COMPLETED)
Drone -> API : POST /missions/:id/result {deviceId, measurements[]}
note right of API
  Accepted only when the mission is COMPLETED
  and has no result yet (409 otherwise).
end note
API --> Drone : MissionResult (no active revision)

== Validation (operator) ==
Operator -> UI : open COMPLETED mission
UI -> API : GET /missions/:id/result
API --> UI : MissionResult + measurements
Operator -> UI : select / reject points, Save or Finalize
UI -> API : POST /missions/:id/result/revisions\n{rejectedMeasurementIds, finalize}\n(Idempotency-Key)
API --> UI : MissionResult (new active revision)

opt finalize == true
  API -> Events : emitResultRevisionFinalized({missionId})
  Events -> SQ : listener -> invalidate()
  SQ -> SQ : drop points snapshot + tile cache
  UI -> Operator : fading advisory\n"Refresh the heatmap"
end

== Exploration (operator) ==
Operator -> UI : Heatmap > Refresh
UI -> API : GET /signal-quality/range
API --> UI : {min, max, version}
UI -> API : GET /signal-quality/tiles/:z/:x/:y?v=version
API --> UI : Float32 grid tile
@enduml
